    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845170/extras/ac02fff382e0ff2936763948e6131c18.poster.avif?t=1751965808\" width=800 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845170/extras/ac02fff382e0ff2936763948e6131c18.webm?t=1751965808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845170/extras/ac02fff382e0ff2936763948e6131c18.mp4?t=1751965808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a life coach. Where you help others meet their goals and succeed in life. As a life coach, you give your time, you give effort, you give compassion, you give wisdom, but most of all you give hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this gamified life coach experience, you are juggling and balancing your knowledge, skills, and\u00a0strategies, to gain trust, build credibility, all while managing stress in order to progress your client's path to solve problems and meet their goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845170/extras/0aae6fc7b7e35fd1a9244e43f4295431.poster.avif?t=1751965808\" width=800 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845170/extras/0aae6fc7b7e35fd1a9244e43f4295431.webm?t=1751965808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845170/extras/0aae6fc7b7e35fd1a9244e43f4295431.mp4?t=1751965808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock all coaches and experience each situation is like being dealt a set of cards where you choose wisely and play the right cards at the right time in order to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are you waiting for? Take your library of knowledge, take your chances and give love, give hope!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life Coach is a roguelike deckbuilder game about reaching your full potential while helping others do the same. We want this game to give you a good laugh, have fun but also play the role of a life coach where you help people by sharing your wisdom in cards.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845170/extras/ac02fff382e0ff2936763948e6131c18.poster.avif?t=1751965808\" width=800 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845170/extras/ac02fff382e0ff2936763948e6131c18.webm?t=1751965808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845170/extras/ac02fff382e0ff2936763948e6131c18.mp4?t=1751965808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a life coach. Where you help others meet their goals and succeed in life. As a life coach, you give your time, you give effort, you give compassion, you give wisdom, but most of all you give hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this gamified life coach experience, you are juggling and balancing your knowledge, skills, and\u00a0strategies, to gain trust, build credibility, all while managing stress in order to progress your client's path to solve problems and meet their goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845170/extras/0aae6fc7b7e35fd1a9244e43f4295431.poster.avif?t=1751965808\" width=800 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845170/extras/0aae6fc7b7e35fd1a9244e43f4295431.webm?t=1751965808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845170/extras/0aae6fc7b7e35fd1a9244e43f4295431.mp4?t=1751965808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock all coaches and experience each situation is like being dealt a set of cards where you choose wisely and play the right cards at the right time in order to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are you waiting for? Take your library of knowledge, take your chances and give love, give hope!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life Coach is a roguelike deckbuilder game about reaching your full potential while helping others do the same. We want this game to give you a good laugh, have fun but also play the role of a life coach where you help people by sharing your wisdom in cards.</p>",
